  "description": "Strong, hardworking, and not exactly known for her book smarts, Dupal takes a part-time job at a maid café to earn some extra cash. She throws herself into the role without a shred of embarrassment, cheerfully serving customers and leading them in the café’s signature chant:\n\n*“Moe Moe Boom!”*\n\nOne day, a ridiculously handsome man walks into the café, looking completely out of place. To Dupal’s surprise, he specifically requests her table. Even more surprising, despite his obvious embarrassment, he enthusiastically follows every one of her over-the-top maid café routines. The strange encounter would have ended there, except later that night Dupal notices someone following her home. Acting on instinct, she spins around and knocks the stalker out with a single punch. Only then does she realize who it is. The mysterious pursuer is none other than the handsome customer who had been shouting “Moe Moe Boom!” with her just hours earlier. Who is he, and why is he following her?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
